pressionId":"x_ec77ea58727e83b46b6e","language":"ja","text":"【句動】故障する,失敗する,を破壊する / 《...に》を分解する《into ...》/ 取り乱す,精神的に参る / （化学分解を受けて）を分離する","source":"PHaVE"},{"id":"m_eae21c58295db4c50d9a","expressionId":"x_244272a1d4f7ab9e0fd4","language":"ja","text":"を明確に説明する / を並べる, を広げる","source":"PHaVE"},{"id":"m_f4c4de8fe6a3f8066fb6","expressionId":"x_12559fdb2f43e7d8948b","language":"ja","text":"【句動】（場内に）入る, うまく入り込む, 入場を許可される / 《活動に》参加する,加わる,《市場に》参入する《on ...》","source":"PHaVE"},{"id":"m_bd39105b1d334ce8e9dd","expressionId":"x_385248515e101c94bacf","language":"ja","text":"あそこに, 向こうで([[over there]])  / 世の中では / 《米俗》（人・考え方などが）普通でない, 並外れた","source":"PHRASE"},{"id":"m_79e26f8d9874936acc8e","expressionId":"x_bd7f811f0654e457e7a4","language":"ja","text":"たった1つの, 《not ~》 ただの1つの...もない / 単独の,単一の,バラの / 一人用の / 独身の / 片方だけの","source":"PHRASE"},{"id":"m_a3ff1433e4c2fc0373b1","expressionId":"x_52e2b881f78798741377","language":"ja","text":"【形】奇妙な, 風変わりな, 普通ではない / 半端な, 余りの, 片方だけの","source":"PHRASE"},{"id":"m_2860dcee0b1f3d065837","expressionId":"x_bad80bb77fea73df2e2b","language":"ja","text":"《話》...しなければならない","source":"PHRASE"},{"id":"m_a90cb4090a1c65a753f1","expressionId":"x_c5fe4ac6f485ee7b0fb3","language":"ja","text":"...だけでなく /  ...ばかりか / 《~ A [[but]] [[also]] Bで》 Aだけでなく、Bも","source":"PHRASE"},{"id":"m_3076393405d9f5314b25","expressionId":"x_3fc79125978f873d63e1","language":"ja","text":"（物事の）事実, 実情, 真相 / 《that is ~》そうした事情なので；その通りです / 《If that is ~》もしそうであれば","source":"PHRASE"},{"id":"m_99e5f3f09a51b02646a8","expressionId":"x_655d06ff09f22681be05","language":"ja","text":"（特定の量の時間や労力など）を使う / を議論する,を対処する / （喜びのために）を始める / を取り上げる,を上げる/（時間・場所など）を占める","source":"PHRASE"},{"id":"m_37e6889c1cbdb562a0bd","expressionId":"x_653bb65e88dbb9e30d4d","language":"ja","text":"（人）の代理で,（団体）を代表して / （人など）のために","source":"PHRASE"},{"id":"m_8ddb0440ae02a6675e93","expressionId":"x_79c2a2aa2a2be5222020","language":"ja","text":"《be ~ 》...することが明らかになる《do》","source":"PHRASE"},{"id":"m_efbbcd6104250fca8113","expressionId":"x_a07b42defef5afe1c997","language":"ja","text":"現在のところ, 今や / 現段階では / この場所で","source":"PHRASE"},{"id":"m_60aee0ca99da9195c417","expressionId":"x_284d25f4f05f73d9c747","language":"ja","text":"《くだけて》全然知りません, さあ /《have ~》全く分からない, 見当もつかない","source":"PHRASE"},{"id":"m_8eacdcb75d5b098e2f8a","expressionId":"x_4a1380867f744a778ebe","language":"ja","text":"手元に, 手元の, 手に","source":"PHRASE"},{"id":"m_45c35ef08d0c17b77ac1","expressionId":"x_0e9fb6ef3146150aafa4","language":"ja","text":"（偶然）〈人〉に出くわす, 〈事・物〉を見つける, 《 ~ ... doing》...が...しているのに出くわす / （表現などを通して気持ちや考えが）伝わる, 理解される","source":"PHRASE"},{"id":"m_1a19b2a0c67b7a05c128","expressionId":"x_bef6a4bb30a9d489f3b5","language":"ja","text":"最新の情報を含んだ / 《be ~》《…について》最新の情報に通じて《with ..., on ...》 / 最新式の, 現代的な, 今風の","source":"PHRASE"},{"id":"m_ba4a961c1ed6df4286dc","expressionId":"x_c91fd0e708bbf4c6b23a","language":"ja","text":"死ぬまで, 今後一生, 生涯","source":"PHRASE"},{"id":"m_ee8c30e2ba202433be76","expressionId":"x_a71377339b7aca6ea4c0","language":"ja","text":"《be ~》ほとんど...ない","source":"PHRASE"},{"id":"m_4a3cdfbbccc42801cbaa","expressionId":"x_75fcd478f39b9ebe34ea","language":"ja","text":"...の方を見る / 《援助などを》〈人〉に期待する, に待ち望む《for ... / to do》/  （より良くしようと）...について考える / 《命令形/ ~ it that ...》《....となるように》 注意しろ","source":"PHRASE"},{"id":"m_f4981f0e9ed29266f11b","expressionId":"x_d260e109d077d90c2783","language":"ja","text":"《[[the~|the sight of]]》...を見ること, ...の景色, ...の光景 /《a ~》多数の... / 《[[at ~|at the sight of]]》...を見てすぐ / 《[[can't bear [stand] the ~|can't bear the sight of]]》...が大嫌いである / 《[[catch [get, have] ~|catch sight of]]》...を見つける /《in ~》...が見えるところに / 《[[lose ~|lose sight of]]》...を見失う","source":"PHRASE"},{"id":"m_ec572cf8e5c281954bed","expressionId":"x_14be9ca6ca843ff8030a","language":"ja","text":"...する可能性が最も高い, 最も...しそう《to do》/ 最も可能性が高い,もっともありそうな","source":"PHRASE"},{"id":"m_e593867d363775c6abcd","expressionId":"x_a5a041d592c9298f1b25","language":"ja","text":"《かたく》（物・事）の理由で, ...のおかげで","source":"PHRASE"},{"id":"m_881d69d5f366482ae57c","expressionId":"x_1761f2dffb987352d70e","language":"ja","text":"《しばしば進行形で》...を楽しみに待つ, ...を期待する","source":"PHRASE"},{"id":"m_cceb1fa5cd48f7b38081","expressionId":"x_4d8ec8b91d6e8ec1b5ec","language":"ja","text":"...のすぐ前に,のすぐ前で / ...の前方に, の前方で","source":"PHRASE"},{"id":"m_af4f0ecb659f70014a34","expressionId":"x_af4eeeb096f73c95509a","language":"ja","text":"...という意味では","source":"PHRASE"},{"id":"m_cf61dd61bb263165da97","expressionId":"x_0de94272cec95c90a47c","language":"ja","text":"《...を》始める,着手する《on ... / to do》 / 《...に向かって》出発する《for ...》 / をきちんと説明する","source":"PHRASE"},{"id":"m_8bb2c841aca8d50c5f11","expressionId":"x_800e9b0e59104b9c256e","language":"ja","text":"...にかかっている / （時間など）がかかる","source":"PHRASE"},{"id":"m_f55fa65a70cfc54b142b","expressionId":"x_70223d03c20455938ced","language":"ja","text":"…かどうか /  …であろうとなかろうと / いずれにせよ","source":"PHRASE"},{"id":"m_2d7c470436d6abfaa9c7","expressionId":"x_6347915ed8ad747896e9","language":"ja","text":"ほとんど...できなかった","source":"PHRASE"},{"id":"m_4cbe8b09d7a1af683c8d","expressionId":"x_03d76499694fd9c58f44","language":"ja","text":"さらにもう一つの, さらに別の, なお一層の","source":"PHRASE"},{"id":"m_acbf4db7dba623ace2b7","expressionId":"x_1d3cd275c551ee2a30be","language":"ja","text":"（説明などが）詳細に, 詳しく / 項目ごとに","source":"PHRASE"},{"id":"m_eb2548ff480aabffe049","expressionId":"x_48b58cc991347c14df2f","language":"ja","text":"【形】危険にさらされている / 世話を必要とする / 《be ~》...の危険性がある《for / of / from ...》","source":"PHRASE"},{"id":"m_85710933df4bc5b515ba","expressionId":"x_643c2a168482aff6300b","language":"ja","text":"《話》いつまでも,（これから先も）ずっと, 永久に / これを最後に","source":"PHRASE"},{"id":"m_8c629f2ebb17975e0cb8","expressionId":"x_6b9dcc8b04357cc351f1","language":"ja","text":"【イディオム】〜の場合 / 【フレーズ】〜の例","source":"PHRASE"},{"id":"m_8db1daa46ba4e0725b52","expressionId":"x_c6f0527acdfbc6de9df9","language":"ja","text":"引き返す, 戻る / 元に戻る, 方針を変える / （人）を引き返させる, （物）を戻す","source":"PHRASE"},{"id":"m_a4afa84ba1ff50f20b36","expressionId":"x_f5240bc2cb0f0877c337","language":"ja","text":"〈U〉〈C〉空軍 / 《A- F-》米国空軍,英国空軍(正式にはthe